WHY SHAREALIKE
--------------
The items exist because the instrument this replaces was either dead or an
unlicensed copy of a commercial one. ShareAlike is the term that stops that
happening again: a translated or revised version stays as free as the
original, which is also how volunteer translation in a federated
organisation actually works.

